{"abstract":"Danish language technology has been hindered by a lack of broad-coverage corpora at the scale modern NLP prefers. This paper describes the Danish Gigaword Corpus, the result of a focused effort to provide a diverse and freely-available one billion word corpus of Danish text. The Danish Gigaword corpus covers a wide array of time periods, domains, speakers’ socio-economic status, and Danish dialects.","author_count":17,"contributors":["Strømberg-Derczynski, Leon","Ciosici, Manuel Rafael","Christiansen, Morten H.","Baglini, Rebekah Brita","Dalsgaard, Jacob Aarup","Fusaroli, Riccardo","Henrichsen, Peter Juel","Hvingelby, Rasmus","Kirkedal, Andreas","Kjeldsen, Alex Speed","Ladefoged, Claus","Nielsen, Finn Arup","Madsen, Jens","Petersen, Malte Lau","Rystrøm, Jonathan Hvithamar","Varab, Daniel"],"cuid":["S02-088.44-038416"],"event":{"acronym":"NODALIDA","title":"Nordic Conference on Computational Linguistics"},"filters":{"added":"2022-04","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Cornell University"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-ALX"],"OT":["TV2 Regionerne"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-ALX","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the danish gigaword corpus","src":["itu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/305020079/2021.nodalida_main.46v2.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-088.44-038416","ids":["itu-fba3300f-4eb5-4f20-ba9c-856479f10be8","ku-da3cde90-ac0d-4296-b8da-1a51f43c2351"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Hum